{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847150/extras/5a1f90c5a6251016fc2fe8e02d25f3f3.poster.avif?t=1752175876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847150/extras/5a1f90c5a6251016fc2fe8e02d25f3f3.webm?t=1752175876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847150/extras/5a1f90c5a6251016fc2fe8e02d25f3f3.mp4?t=1752175876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Phoh is a psychological horror and 2.5D platformer adventure game that tells the dark journey of a soul trapped between reality and dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847150/extras/8b7d300c90dc14863c6d719dc381e534.poster.avif?t=1752175876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847150/extras/8b7d300c90dc14863c6d719dc381e534.webm?t=1752175876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847150/extras/8b7d300c90dc14863c6d719dc381e534.mp4?t=1752175876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With its puzzles, intense scenes, and disturbing atmosphere, it drags players into an unforgettable nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847150/extras/86e25ed5471282607a687f72c8359d32.poster.avif?t=1752175876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847150/extras/86e25ed5471282607a687f72c8359d32.webm?t=1752175876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source s